ticle>","moment":"2026-11-28T00:40:05+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-28T00:40:05+08:00","source":"FinanceNewsDaily","topic":"财经","uid":"fefe2e258c9c2472ef9cf71074c29612e97fb8922617e4b6fa918b2dc67f5211"},{"alias":"zaihuapd","day":"2026-11-28","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--side\" data-cat=\"全球\" data-ch=\"zaihuapd\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"zaihuapd\">在花科技圈</span><span class=\"cat\">全球</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-28T00:35:48+08:00\">00:35</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/zaihuapd/45412\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">任正非称美国制裁促华为自立，请《纽约时报》向特朗普转达感谢</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">华为创始人任正非 10 月在深圳总部接受《纽约时报》采访时称，美国制裁推动华为与中国走向自立，并请该报转达对特朗普的感谢。他称华为已成为“我们自己国家的公司”，总部一条走廊被高管称为“特朗普走廊”。\n\n该采访在纽约陪审团裁定华为共谋窃取美国公司商业秘密及涉伊朗银行欺诈罪名成立两天后刊发，华为称裁决“没有法律或事实依据”。任正非还称，中国最终将在芯片上超越美国，“只是时间问题”。\n\nTNW\n\n🌸 科技圈· 茶馆 · 投稿</p><div class=\"card__media\"><button class=\"photo\" type=\"button\" data-image=\"../../media/zaihuapd/45412_1.webp\" aria-label=\"放大图片\"><img src=\"../../media/zaihuapd/45412_1.webp\" alt=\"任正非称美国制裁促华为自立，请《纽约时报》向特朗普转达感谢\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/zaihuapd/45412\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;e6b827d51d26e4d2c4ca5cc8d560714e0ac4c022674ffd69e127cb556b3ea150&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;任正非称美国制裁促华为自立，请《纽约时报》向特朗普转达感谢&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/zaihuapd/45412&quot;, &quot;source&quot;